  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 864f32d36e36a5644aa8fbd495f2626a, type: 3}
  m_Name: DayneQ1.1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  line: I love dragons. Studied them my whole life. They are peaceful, they keep
    to themselves and only engage with humans if they are threatened. The only recorded
    dragon attack on humans was the Screegle Town slaughter, over two hundred years
    ago. Which happened because some fool stole the dragon's eggs. unfortunately
    a lot of people around here seem to hate the dragon. I don't get it.
  option1:
    text: What do you think of Doctor Dibbler?
    next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 83810be8b0939ba47bc750cec0c13442, type: 2}
    action: 0
  option2:
    text: 'Thanks. '
